<!-- wp:group {"className":"fr-hero fr-wrap","layout":{"type":"default"},"tagName":"section"} --><section class="wp-block-group fr-hero fr-wrap"><!-- wp:group {"className":"fr-hero-copy","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><div class="wp-block-group fr-hero-copy"><!-- wp:heading {"level":1} --><h1 class="wp-block-heading">Prayer belongs<br>in family life.</h1><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"fr-lead"} --><p class="fr-lead">A quiet moment. A busy kitchen. A family finding its way. Wherever you begin, we’ll help you pray together.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:group {"className":"fr-actions","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><div class="wp-block-group fr-actions"><!-- wp:button {"className":"is-style-fill"} --><div class="wp-block-button is-style-fill"><a class="wp-block-button__link wp-element-button" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/#pray-today' ) ); ?>">Pray with us today</a></div><!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {"className":"is-style-outline"} --><div class="wp-block-button is-style-outline"><a class="wp-block-button__link wp-element-button" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/how-to-pray-the-rosary/' ) ); ?>">Learn the Rosary</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"fr-soft"} --><p class="fr-soft">No experience needed. Bring the family you have.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {"className":"fr-hero-art","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><div class="wp-block-group fr-hero-art"><!-- wp:image {"className":"fr-hero-photo"} --><figure class="wp-block-image fr-hero-photo"><img src="<?php echo esc_url( get_theme_file_uri( 'assets/family-prayer.webp' ) ); ?>" alt="Adults and children praying together around an open Bible."/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"fr-photo-note"} --><p class="fr-photo-note">Make room for a moment together.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></section><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {"className":"fr-wrap fr-section fr-start","layout":{"type":"default"},"tagName":"section"} --><section class="wp-block-group fr-wrap fr-section fr-start"><!-- wp:heading {"level":2} --><h2 class="wp-block-heading">What would help your family today?</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:group {"className":"fr-paths","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><div class="wp-block-group fr-paths"><!-- wp:group {"className":"fr-path","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><div class="wp-block-group fr-path"><!-- wp:heading {"level":3} --><h3 class="wp-block-heading"><a class="text-link" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/how-to-pray-the-rosary/' ) ); ?>">We’re new to the Rosary</a></h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Follow the steps, with the prayer words close at hand.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {"className":"fr-path","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><div class="wp-block-group fr-path"><!-- wp:heading {"level":3} --><h3 class="wp-block-heading"><a class="text-link" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/prayerresources/?topic=children' ) ); ?>">I’m praying with children</a></h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Find simple ideas, printable activities and shared moments.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {"className":"fr-path","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><div class="wp-block-group fr-path"><!-- wp:heading {"level":3} --><h3 class="wp-block-heading"><a class="text-link" href="https://www.worldatprayer.org/">Our family needs prayer</a></h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Ask for prayer and join a community praying for others.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:group --></section><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {"className":"fr-today fr-wrap fr-section","layout":{"type":"default"},"tagName":"section","anchor":"pray-today"} --><section id="pray-today" class="wp-block-group fr-today fr-wrap fr-section"><!-- wp:group {"className":"fr-today-intro","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><div class="wp-block-group fr-today-intro"><!-- wp:heading {"level":2} --><h2 class="wp-block-heading">A little time.<br>A prayer together.</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"fr-lead"} --><p class="fr-lead">The Rosary invites us to reflect on the life of Jesus with Mary. Begin with one decade, or stay for all five.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"fr-soft"} --><p class="fr-soft">Choose a mystery for today. The usual weekday pattern is a guide; you can pray any mystery.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {"className":"fr-today-prayer","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><div class="wp-block-group fr-today-prayer"><!-- wp:html --><p class="fr-date" data-today-date>Pray today</p><h3 class="fr-today-title" data-today-mystery>The Glorious Mysteries</h3><p data-today-summary>Reflect on the Resurrection and the hope of new life.</p><!-- /wp:html --><!-- wp:group {"className":"fr-actions","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><div class="wp-block-group fr-actions"><!-- wp:button {"className":"is-style-fill"} --><div class="wp-block-button is-style-fill"><a class="wp-block-button__link wp-element-button" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/how-to-pray-the-rosary/#guided-prayer' ) ); ?>">Begin a guided decade</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a class="text-link" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/how-to-pray-the-rosary/#mysteries' ) ); ?>">See all four sets of mysteries</a></p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"fr-small"} --><p class="fr-small"><a class="text-link" href="https://www.youtube.com/@FamilyRosaryVideo/streams">Join the live Rosary and Mass</a><br>Weekdays: Rosary at 11:30 a.m. · Mass at noon ET.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></section><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {"className":"fr-wrap fr-section fr-family","layout":{"type":"default"},"tagName":"section"} --><section class="wp-block-group fr-wrap fr-section fr-family"><!-- wp:image {"className":"fr-family-photo"} --><figure class="wp-block-image fr-family-photo"><img src="<?php echo esc_url( get_theme_file_uri( 'assets/family-rosary.webp' ) ); ?>" alt="A family holding Rosary beads beside a statue of Father Peyton."/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:group {"className":"fr-family-copy","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><div class="wp-block-group fr-family-copy"><!-- wp:heading {"level":2} --><h2 class="wp-block-heading">Small beginnings.<br>Room to grow.</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"fr-lead"} --><p class="fr-lead">Some evenings everyone is ready. Other evenings, one child is restless and someone is running late. Prayer can still be part of your family’s day.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Choose a moment you already share. Let each person offer an intention. Give children a prayer to lead. Start with what you can do together, then keep growing.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a class="text-link" href="https://blog.familyrosary.org/10-creative-tips-for-praying-as-a-family-0">Find ideas for praying as a family</a></p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a class="text-link" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/prayerresources/?topic=children' ) ); ?>">Explore printables for children</a></p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></section><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {"className":"fr-wrap fr-section fr-home-resources","layout":{"type":"default"},"tagName":"section"} --><section class="wp-block-group fr-wrap fr-section fr-home-resources"><!-- wp:group {"className":"fr-resource-intro","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><div class="wp-block-group fr-resource-intro"><!-- wp:heading {"level":2} --><h2 class="wp-block-heading">Something to take<br>into everyday life.</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Prayer guides, reflections and activities you can use at home, at school or in your parish.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a class="text-link" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/prayerresources/' ) ); ?>">Explore the resource library</a></p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {"className":"fr-resource-lines","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><div class="wp-block-group fr-resource-lines"><!-- wp:group {"className":"fr-resource-line","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><div class="wp-block-group fr-resource-line"><!-- wp:heading {"level":3} --><h3 class="wp-block-heading"><a class="text-link" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/prayerresources/?topic=rosary' ) ); ?>">A guide to the Rosary</a></h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Keep the steps and prayers beside you. English, Spanish and Portuguese.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {"className":"fr-resource-line","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><div class="wp-block-group fr-resource-line"><!-- wp:heading {"level":3} --><h3 class="wp-block-heading"><a class="text-link" href="https://www.familyrosary.org/prayerresources">Family Rosary Companion</a></h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Find the four mysteries in the existing English and Spanish collection.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {"className":"fr-resource-line","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><div class="wp-block-group fr-resource-line"><!-- wp:heading {"level":3} --><h3 class="wp-block-heading"><a class="text-link" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/prayerresources/?format=Reflection' ) ); ?>">Pray with images</a></h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Let sacred art help you reflect on the mysteries.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:group --></section><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {"className":"fr-wrap fr-section fr-home-media","layout":{"type":"default"},"tagName":"section"} --><section class="wp-block-group fr-wrap fr-section fr-home-media"><!-- wp:group {"className":"fr-home-media-copy","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><div class="wp-block-group fr-hom