s/father-peyton.webp' ) ); ?>" alt="Archival photograph of Father Peyton addressing a large outdoor crowd."/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:group {"className":"fr-story-copy","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><div class="wp-block-group fr-story-copy"><!-- wp:heading {"level":2} --><h2 class="wp-block-heading">One family’s prayer.<br>A worldwide mission.</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"fr-quote"} --><p class="fr-quote">“The family that prays together stays together.”</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Venerable Patrick Peyton believed in the power of family prayer. Family Rosary continues that invitation through prayer, resources and ministry with families around the world.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a class="text-link" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/our-story/' ) ); ?>">Meet Father Peyton and our mission</a></p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></section><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {"className":"fr-wrap fr-section fr-giving","layout":{"type":"default"},"tagName":"section"} --><section class="wp-block-group fr-wrap fr-section fr-giving"><!-- wp:heading {"level":2} --><h2 class="wp-block-heading">Help another family<br>find its way to prayer.</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Your support helps Family Rosary share the gift of prayer with families.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:group {"className":"fr-actions","layout":{"type":"default"}} --><div class="wp-block-group fr-actions"><!-- wp:button {"className":"is-style-outline"} --><div class="wp-block-button is-style-outline"><a class="wp-block-button__link wp-element-button" href="https://www.familyrosary.org/support-family-rosary">Support Family Rosary</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:group --></section><!-- /wp:group -->
